what's going on guys this is rob and we  are back again with another installment  of our beyond omega level series where  we discuss the most powerful characters  in comics and in our recent video on  scar son of the hulk one commenter  cosmic dropout pointed out that hulk has  another son who's probably more powerful  than scar named hirokala yes i know we  covered him in our incredible hulk  playlist so that's the one that we're  going to talk about today and we're  going to start by going over his origin  and then moving on to his powers and his  feats so hirokala was created by greg  pack and ron garney and first appeared  in scar son of hulk number two in 2008.  now just like scar hiro caller's origin  is rooted on the planet hulk storyline  which saw the illuminati a group  consisting of charles xavier tony stark  namor blackbull reed richards and doctor  strange basically deciding the hulk was  too dangerous for earth and then sending  him into space on a rocket with the  intention of him going to an uninhabited  world where he would just basically  spend his time in peace because there'd  be nobody around for him to hurt what  happened though is that the hulk ended  up on the war-torn planet known as  sakhar he overthrows the dictator of  sakhar falls in love with a woman named  kaira she gets pregnant and then the  ship that brought the hulk to sakhar  basically blows up and kills her what we  don't know at the time however was that  kiera was actually pregnant with twins  because comics and both of them ended up  surviving the explosion now one of the  twins is scar who's able to survive  because he has the physiology and  therefore the durability of the hulk his  twin hirokala does not have the hulk's  physiology but is able to unwittingly  harness an ancient energy source known  as the old power to save himself by  basically hardening his skin which  allows him to survive the ship's  explosion shortly after this though  hirokala is enslaved on sakhar by a one  lord named axeman bone and after  learning about the old power hirokala  encounters a priest named hiro amin who  had once wielded the old power now hiro  amen then tells hirokala that to get the  old power one must kill someone who  possesses it and naturally this leads to  hero colic healing hero amun but he  doesn't really inherit the old power and  figures out that the priest had actually  lied to him now axeman bone frees  hirokala and then gives him a spot on  his honor guard and they set out to stop  scar who was on the verge of taking the  old power for himself although hirokala  begs scar not to take the old power he  does which prompts a silver surfer to  come to sakaar and challenge scar  himself now hirokala took this  opportunity to free as many slaves as  possible and began amassing an army to  overthrow his brother but galactus comes  to sakaar and basically devours it now  hirokala escapes the planet on a stone  ship saving the last surviving members  of his race in the process and then  reveals that some of the old power still  lives on within him and then promises  that he will make galactus pay for  consuming sakhar now as for his powers  there are three sources from which  hirokala derives his abilities the first  of these of course is the old power  which is an ancient source of energy  that was wielded by the shadow people  the race of aliens that hero kala's  mother belonged to the all power was  created in an attempt to rival the power  cosmic which is basically the power  galactus has and the power the silver  surfer uses but the old power proved to  be much less stable than the power  cosmic and in fact it was so powerful  that it nearly destroyed a quarter of  the known universe now in his quest for  vengeance against galactus hirokala  manages to create a new power which was  a combination of the old power and the  power cosmic that's fueled by hate which  hirokala possesses in abundance due to  the anger he feels towards galactus now  later hirokala's ship would wind up in  the microverse where he finds a planet  called kai and on that planet he  discovers the world mind a sort of  planetary consciousness now hirokal is  able to take control of some of the  world mind's power and uses it to  enslave the people of kai before heading  to earth to confront his brother scar  and so with these three sources of power  it's obvious that hirokala is  ridiculously powerful so let's take a  look at some of the feats that he's  pulled off right first of all he has an  insane level of durability having taken  multiple strikes from the hulk and scar  as well as a blast from a powerful  artifact called the enigma force  nullifier now in addition to his  durability hirokala can use his powers  offensively and he's so powerful that  this battle with scar literally broke a  planet apart he's also able to project  powerful beams and is able to incinerate  enemies at will hirokala also has potent  telekinetic power which allows him to  fly and also make people's heads explode  with his thoughts which is kind of wild  now one of the primary abilities of the  old power is that it allows its wielders  to manipulate the plate tectonic  energies of a planet which means that  basically he can move the plates that  make up a planet around him so he can  use this to tear a planet apart or to  move a planet through space which he did  with the planet kai which he moved from  jupiter to earth in 43 hours that's a  distance of 365 million miles which  means he was moving the planet in excess  of 8.4 million miles per hour now he's  also able to pull the planet kai which  is roughly the size of mars out of its  orbit so we're talking about someone who  can move planets at will that's just a  ridiculous level of power but the thing  hirokala is best known for is poisoning  galactus which he did while galactus was  attempting to devour a planet which  contained a large supply of the old  power and this takes place after  hirokala had basically taken control of  the planet and convinced most of its  citizens that he was a god but  regardless as galactus is devouring this  world hirokala mixes the old power with  the power cosmic which effectively  poisons galactus and causes him to feel  the pain of the souls he was destroying  and this is pretty unfortunate for him  because at this point he's addicted to  the old power but he knows it could  potentially destroy him the next time he  consumes it something else here though  is that hiro kala is able to survive a  blast from galactus although he does  suffer a severe burn in the process now  as powerful as hirocala is however he of  course had to eventually lose to the  good guys and was beaten to the point of  death by his father the hulk but the  whole could not bring himself to kill  his son and so following this hirokala  would be attacked by his brother scar  and the two of them engage in an epic  battle with both of them wielding the  old power until scar manages to gain the  victory by encasing his brother in stone  notice at this point that hiro kala is  absorbed by the core of the planet kai  at the direction of the world mind so  that his power could basically heal that  planet and that's the last we've seen of  hiro kala even when scar tried to  release him from the world minds control  at the hulk's request but was unable to  do so so yeah that's the deal with the  hulk's other son who is insanely  powerful but was only used in a handful  of appearances maybe we'll see him up  here in the comics at some future point  in time i have no idea but with that  being said guys we're gonna bring this  to an end thank you all for watching and  i will catch you all later  peace
 

